WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:32.560
EIGHT-DIRECTIONS GOODS SHOP

01:32.640 --> 01:33.600
Alright.

01:36.880 --> 01:39.080
EIGHT-DIRECTIONS GOODS SHOP

01:39.160 --> 01:41.040
-Mr. Sun.
-Mr. Su.

01:41.120 --> 01:43.040
It's only been a few days.
Here to collect debts again?

01:43.120 --> 01:43.960
No.

01:44.800 --> 01:47.120
I just wanted to ask about something.

01:47.200 --> 01:49.720
What do young ladies
usually like to eat here?

01:50.520 --> 01:53.880
The young ladies on these streets
all love my snow-pear tonic.

01:54.480 --> 01:55.640
Snow-pear tonic?

01:56.160 --> 01:58.200
Yes. That one.

01:58.280 --> 01:59.800
Give me one to go.

01:59.880 --> 02:02.080
All right, please wait a moment.

02:05.040 --> 02:07.520
Go ahead and enjoy my snow-pear tonic.

02:07.600 --> 02:08.680
I'll choose a good one.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.880
-This one?
-This will do.

02:13.080 --> 02:14.960
And these red beans.

02:15.040 --> 02:16.480
I'll give you extra to take along.

02:17.600 --> 02:18.920
Enjoy it.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.600
You are welcome back anytime.

02:21.320 --> 02:22.520
Here you go, Mr. Su.

02:24.880 --> 02:25.840
Thank you, Mr. Sun.

02:26.520 --> 02:27.360
No, Mr. Su.

02:27.440 --> 02:28.920
-How could I take your money?
-Take it.

02:30.120 --> 02:31.640
No.

02:32.600 --> 02:34.280
Then, thank you, Mr. Su.

02:56.840 --> 02:58.920
Lying low.

02:59.440 --> 03:01.800
The wind will stop soon enough.

03:02.440 --> 03:03.280
But look at you.

03:03.360 --> 03:05.520
Doing all this makes it look as if

03:05.600 --> 03:06.880
I were truly planning to flee.

03:07.600 --> 03:08.800
Boss.

03:08.880 --> 03:10.760
Who do you think you can fool?
You cannot fool me.

03:11.480 --> 03:12.480
Did you not once say

03:12.560 --> 03:15.600
that half of Chang'an belonged
to you, Boss?

03:15.680 --> 03:16.640
But the one you serve

03:17.880 --> 03:19.080
is Emperor Yan.

03:19.160 --> 03:21.920
With such a powerful backer,
why would you need to lie low?

03:22.960 --> 03:25.240
Then the one you offended

03:26.000 --> 03:27.400
must be Emperor Yan.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.520
You brat.

03:31.120 --> 03:32.680
You are a little too clever.

03:33.880 --> 03:35.000
So I guessed right, didn't I?

03:35.920 --> 03:37.000
Then this really is fleeing.

03:37.720 --> 03:39.560
So bringing all these things is right.

03:39.640 --> 03:41.480
I should have brought even more.

03:49.200 --> 03:50.440
Tell me,

03:50.520 --> 03:52.880
what if we never return?

03:52.960 --> 03:54.920
We would not worry about living.

03:55.440 --> 03:57.560
Boss, your business
spans the entire realm.

03:58.160 --> 03:59.920
Even if they liquidate
one shop after another,

04:00.000 --> 04:02.120
they will not finish
in eight or ten years.

04:02.800 --> 04:04.520
But Boss,

04:05.160 --> 04:06.320
you still need someone at your side.

04:07.480 --> 04:09.400
I must find the right person for you

04:09.480 --> 04:10.520
and be sure they're worthy.

04:11.640 --> 04:12.680
Why is that?

04:13.520 --> 04:16.800
Boss, do you not know yourself?

04:17.399 --> 04:18.920
You are not an easy master to serve.

04:23.720 --> 04:25.320
Is that not why I have you?

04:26.440 --> 04:28.160
Losing a bit of business is nothing.

04:28.240 --> 04:30.800
Do not worry.
I will still pay you double wages.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.280
This is not about wages.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.480
If that day truly comes,

04:36.160 --> 04:37.640
once I settle you properly,

04:38.720 --> 04:40.240
I will still return to Chang'an.

04:42.400 --> 04:44.800
For that girl at the clinic?

04:45.400 --> 04:46.480
No.

04:48.400 --> 04:49.920
Boss, you have forgotten, have you not?

04:53.280 --> 04:55.840
I remember.
Your revenge has not been taken yet.

04:56.880 --> 04:57.800
Yes.

04:59.760 --> 05:00.960
With blood unavenged,

05:02.920 --> 05:03.960
I am unworthy as a son.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.080
His story is the same as yours.

05:08.160 --> 05:10.160
He carries a hatred as deep as the sea.

05:10.240 --> 05:12.720
That child came from Pingfang Township,

05:12.800 --> 05:15.160
a run-down village outside Chang'an.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.960
When he was 11 years old,

05:17.040 --> 05:18.920
he saw with his own eyes

05:19.000 --> 05:21.920
his father trampled to death
by a young master riding back to Chang'an.

05:22.000 --> 05:25.800
From then on,
he swore to avenge that blood debt.

05:25.880 --> 05:28.560
He waited five years
before coming to Chang'an,

05:28.640 --> 05:30.320
bringing all his belongings.

05:30.400 --> 05:34.000
A total of 17 wen
was only enough to buy one knife.

05:35.640 --> 05:36.720
Why wait?

05:37.880 --> 05:40.320
He waited until his mother passed away.

05:41.280 --> 05:44.240
Because if he died first,
he would fail in his filial duty

05:44.320 --> 05:45.920
and she would grieve.

05:46.800 --> 05:48.280
When he found the young master,

05:48.360 --> 05:50.440
the young master's family
had already fallen,

05:50.520 --> 05:52.800
leaving only him and his mother

05:52.880 --> 05:55.360
living in a weed-choked courtyard.

05:55.440 --> 05:57.320
When the boy surnamed Su saw this,

05:57.400 --> 05:59.120
he did not strike.

05:59.200 --> 06:00.440
He began to wait again.

06:01.240 --> 06:03.720
Later he met Yang Chuhao.

06:03.800 --> 06:06.760
Yang Chuhao learned his story
and asked him

06:07.360 --> 06:09.480
whether he spared him out of softness.

06:10.240 --> 06:11.240
He said no.

06:12.160 --> 06:14.880
No matter how miserable
a foe becomes, he is still a foe.

06:14.960 --> 06:16.960
And when it comes to vengeance,
he will show no mercy.

06:17.800 --> 06:19.800
But he had to wait a little longer.

06:20.760 --> 06:23.200
He would only act
after the young master's mother died.

06:23.280 --> 06:24.480
Only then would he strike.

06:25.040 --> 06:27.760
Because if the young master died,

06:27.840 --> 06:29.920
there would be no one left
to care for his mother.

06:31.840 --> 06:34.680
Later on, Yang Chuhao took him in.

06:34.760 --> 06:37.240
That child was truly clever,
one in a thousand.

06:37.320 --> 06:38.920
And meticulous.

06:39.000 --> 06:41.640
Naturally he became
Yang Chuhao's confidant.

06:41.720 --> 06:43.440
Yang, as I see it,

06:44.680 --> 06:46.600
raised him like a son.

06:58.880 --> 07:00.320
Boss, how could you do work like this?

07:00.400 --> 07:01.600
Let me handle it.

07:01.680 --> 07:03.720
Kid, it's not that bad. I can do it.

07:04.360 --> 07:05.680
It is that bad.

07:05.760 --> 07:07.240
I have to do everything I can

07:07.880 --> 07:09.600
to be worthy of the wages Boss gives me.

07:10.440 --> 07:11.720
You.

07:12.880 --> 07:15.520
What if one day I really run away,

07:15.600 --> 07:17.440
and you're not by my side?

07:17.520 --> 07:18.680
What am I to do then?

07:32.360 --> 07:33.840
This story

07:34.960 --> 07:36.000
is fake.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.600
Only two people can tell

07:42.680 --> 07:43.960
that this story is fake.

07:44.040 --> 07:47.160
You and me.

07:48.560 --> 07:50.400
Yang

07:53.440 --> 07:55.120
doesn't know.

08:03.200 --> 08:05.800
What caught my eye was not his cleverness,

08:05.880 --> 08:07.840
but how well he hid himself.

08:07.920 --> 08:10.440
He lived as an obedient servant,

08:10.520 --> 08:12.760
and might have lived that way forever,

08:12.840 --> 08:14.520
earning himself a reputation
as a kind man.

08:14.600 --> 08:16.320
That would've been no ill fate.

08:16.960 --> 08:18.640
But when the chance comes,

08:18.720 --> 08:21.400
he will remember that he is no good man,

08:22.240 --> 08:25.040
but a flower grown from poisoned soil.

08:54.440 --> 08:58.160
How did you know
Su Changlin's story was fake?

08:58.760 --> 09:00.600
People who have crawled out of hell

09:02.520 --> 09:03.840
are easily content

09:04.600 --> 09:06.280
with ordinary things.

09:08.360 --> 09:09.960
But when something seems too good,

09:10.760 --> 09:12.720
they usually don't believe it.

09:13.720 --> 09:15.520
I spoke with Su Changlin.

09:16.200 --> 09:18.560
He could become an excellent Huben member.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.440
But before that day comes,

09:21.520 --> 09:23.840
he needs a merit to his name.

09:23.920 --> 09:27.320
At this very moment, Yang Chuhao's life

09:28.200 --> 09:31.360
has already become that merit.

09:34.160 --> 09:36.400
Yang is your father's old friend,

09:36.480 --> 09:37.800
and my friend.

09:37.880 --> 09:40.000
I do not rejoice in his death,

09:40.080 --> 09:41.600
not in the least.

09:42.560 --> 09:44.720
But he must die.

09:47.200 --> 09:50.400
Sure enough, in this world,

09:50.480 --> 09:53.040
anything that seems too good

09:53.120 --> 09:56.520
is rarely worth trusting.

10:59.560 --> 11:01.720
Tell me honestly,
do you really have to go?

11:03.880 --> 11:06.000
The moment the siege
on Yan Fengshan failed,

11:06.080 --> 11:09.120
I knew the Huben in Chang'an

11:09.200 --> 11:10.800
had not been wiped out completely.

11:11.720 --> 11:13.200
If you ask whether there is anyone

11:13.280 --> 11:16.200
in this dynasty worth trusting,
there must be.

11:17.160 --> 11:18.680
But I do not dare to gamble.

11:19.680 --> 11:21.680
No matter whom I entrust with command,
I cannot rest easy.

11:22.280 --> 11:24.360
I must go north myself,

11:24.960 --> 11:26.400
bring back the Baiwenhu,

11:27.000 --> 11:28.600
and retake Chang'an.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.800
The journey is long,

11:31.880 --> 11:33.080
and you have only a few men.

11:33.800 --> 11:36.240
Be careful along the way.

11:37.560 --> 11:38.400
Do not worry.

11:38.480 --> 11:41.000
This time I will not let the general
come to any harm.

11:43.800 --> 11:45.280
After nightfall,
leave through Jinguang Gate.

11:45.360 --> 11:47.040
Master has arranged someone
to meet you there.

11:48.520 --> 11:49.440
My thanks for your help.

11:51.480 --> 11:53.360
Huai'an risked his life to enter the game

11:54.080 --> 11:56.160
to buy my return from the palace

11:56.800 --> 12:00.160
and to make Wuyin Chong
agree to his terms.

12:00.240 --> 12:02.280
I do not know

12:02.360 --> 12:04.120
whether he ever said

12:04.200 --> 12:08.000
what one must do
to leave Yan Fengshan's side.

12:10.600 --> 12:12.520
The letter he left behind

12:13.920 --> 12:15.080
did not mention it either.

12:17.120 --> 12:18.480
That courtyard seems ordinary,

12:18.560 --> 12:20.680
but it is full of hidden traps.

12:20.760 --> 12:22.680
There must be secret sentries all around.

12:23.360 --> 12:24.960
With the forces we can muster now,

12:25.040 --> 12:28.360
breaking in would be extremely difficult.

12:28.440 --> 12:29.760
You must not attack by force.

12:30.480 --> 12:32.560
Even if you break through
the outer defenses,

12:32.640 --> 12:34.080
Yan Fengshan is still inside.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.480
In today's Chang'an,

12:37.560 --> 12:41.280
there is no longer anyone
who can stand against him.

12:45.040 --> 12:46.520
There is no need to worry too much.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.240
By now you surely know Xie Huai'an.

12:49.840 --> 12:52.200
He must have prepared
a formidable backup plan.

12:52.800 --> 12:53.640
Do not worry.

12:54.520 --> 12:55.360
Indeed.

12:56.240 --> 12:58.760
I promised him that I would not die.

12:59.360 --> 13:01.080
Then he will not die either.

13:02.920 --> 13:03.840
Everyone,

13:04.680 --> 13:05.760
I must trouble you

13:07.520 --> 13:09.120
with everything in Chang'an.

14:08.920 --> 14:10.640
So many people have died.

14:12.120 --> 14:14.120
We have to burn some money
to send down to them.

14:15.000 --> 14:16.800
Burn some for Yang Chuhao as well.

14:17.400 --> 14:18.760
After all, he is your friend.

14:28.960 --> 14:30.760
Not only Yang Chuhao.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.960
Tonight is also
Wang Pu's first seven days.

14:34.560 --> 14:37.000
I sent Zhiying to burn paper at his grave.

14:39.200 --> 14:40.920
The child you raised for 25 years

14:43.200 --> 14:44.600
was your shackle.

14:45.400 --> 14:46.760
If not for him,

14:47.720 --> 14:50.120
you would have lost control
of your urge to kill

14:50.800 --> 14:52.160
and turned into a madman long ago.

14:52.800 --> 14:54.800
It does not sit well with you, does it?

15:04.000 --> 15:07.280
Bai Wan's death
must have grieved you deeply.

15:09.280 --> 15:11.440
She was the only family you had left.

15:12.240 --> 15:14.920
You hid her away and guarded her.

15:16.120 --> 15:18.200
In the end she was stabbed to death.

15:25.280 --> 15:26.680
She is buried right here.

15:28.280 --> 15:29.720
Of course I know that.

15:30.240 --> 15:32.120
From the moment
we moved to this courtyard,

15:32.720 --> 15:34.960
no one has dared set foot
on this patch of ground.

15:47.280 --> 15:49.320
You really are so tender-hearted.

15:50.120 --> 15:53.600
When she turned one,
I carved her amulet myself.

15:55.600 --> 15:58.880
Naturally, I felt sorry for her.

15:59.960 --> 16:01.280
But I still had to kill her.

16:02.280 --> 16:04.920
Killing her and breaking you

16:05.720 --> 16:07.880
were the only way I could win.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.760
And you really did it.

16:15.360 --> 16:17.520
I have always worked with great care,

16:17.600 --> 16:19.920
spending a great deal of time
on my layouts,

16:22.200 --> 16:23.960
thinking through every detail.

16:25.040 --> 16:26.280
Yet in the end,

16:27.280 --> 16:28.680
I was still one move short,

16:30.640 --> 16:33.040
and all my last kin died.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.040
She died.

16:36.880 --> 16:39.040
That was when I became a madman.

17:01.520 --> 17:02.920
Do you know that?

17:05.480 --> 17:06.800
I can see her.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.400
At first I only saw her once in a while.

17:37.880 --> 17:38.760
Slowly,

17:39.520 --> 17:41.480
she began to appear more often.

17:44.480 --> 17:45.720
Later,

17:47.240 --> 17:49.400
whenever I thought of her,

17:51.080 --> 17:53.240
she would appear by my side.

17:55.800 --> 17:56.680
White Hair.

18:03.880 --> 18:04.720
What is it?

18:05.520 --> 18:06.480
Very mad, am I?

18:07.840 --> 18:09.880
But if you cast reality aside…

18:16.560 --> 18:18.280
and imagine wildly

18:18.880 --> 18:22.040
that the dead could be brought back
to your side.

18:24.000 --> 18:25.560
Do you not find that amusing?

18:33.480 --> 18:35.320
Can you not see Wang Pu?

18:46.040 --> 18:47.720
So it is not you who is mad,

18:47.800 --> 18:49.240
it is me who is mad.

18:55.120 --> 18:56.840
It is not you who is mad,

18:58.320 --> 18:59.560
it is me who is mad.

19:33.080 --> 19:34.520
This is your junior sister's clinic.

19:34.600 --> 19:35.880
You are not even helping.

19:37.360 --> 19:40.160
Do your work. Stop talking nonsense.

19:43.520 --> 19:45.600
My eyelid has been twitching
for the past two days.

19:47.920 --> 19:49.600
I wonder how matters stand with Huai'an.

20:26.200 --> 20:32.520
‎BLESSINGS ABOUND, MISFORTUNE FADES

20:36.920 --> 20:37.960
Do not move.

20:40.520 --> 20:42.200
Careful, there may be hidden weapons.

21:07.160 --> 21:09.800
Xiaoqing, this is for you.

21:17.880 --> 21:19.880
Then I will take it back to my room first,

21:19.960 --> 21:22.200
so you two won't steal
my late-night snack.

21:34.880 --> 21:37.440
Xiaoqing has never been good at the arts,

21:37.520 --> 21:38.400
but she is a glutton.

21:39.080 --> 21:41.600
May I ask you, what does she like to eat?

21:42.320 --> 21:44.040
She does like a few sweet treats.

21:52.880 --> 21:54.280
What are you thinking about?

21:54.880 --> 21:56.960
Someone fancies your junior sister,
and you're displeased?

21:57.600 --> 22:01.040
This dessert was given
by that servant beside Yang Chuhao.

22:01.120 --> 22:02.600
He likes Xiaoqing.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.680
Huai'an and I both know.

22:06.960 --> 22:07.800
So?

22:07.880 --> 22:10.240
He is the closest person to Yang Chuhao,

22:11.000 --> 22:12.480
like his adopted son.

22:13.360 --> 22:14.720
Huai'an had me investigate him.

22:16.160 --> 22:18.080
So what exactly are you trying to say?

22:18.160 --> 22:19.920
What I am trying to say is

22:20.000 --> 22:22.040
Yang Chuhao is currently fleeing
for his life,

22:22.120 --> 22:23.920
so there is no reason
he would not take him along.

22:25.080 --> 22:27.520
At a time like this,
for him to suddenly appear in Chang'an

22:28.840 --> 22:29.680
is very strange.

22:33.000 --> 22:33.960
I understand.

22:34.800 --> 22:37.040
That guy might actually be a traitor.

22:39.360 --> 22:41.520
Master has not sent word yet.

22:41.600 --> 22:43.440
We do not know whether Yang Chuhao

22:43.520 --> 22:45.080
has entered Cangshui River.

22:45.680 --> 22:46.840
If he has not entered yet,

22:47.440 --> 22:49.000
then that guy is certainly suspect.

22:50.280 --> 22:51.560
While he has not gone far,

22:51.640 --> 22:52.760
I will follow him.

22:54.400 --> 22:56.280
This is Chang'an City.
Stop wandering around.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.280
Take good care of your face.

22:58.880 --> 22:59.760
I am going.

24:13.160 --> 24:15.000
Gu Yu has been rescued.

24:15.080 --> 24:16.600
Wuyin Chong has left.

24:18.320 --> 24:20.880
You entered the game in person
and won half a move.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.760
But what comes next?

24:23.440 --> 24:26.040
You are not someone who leaves no way out.

24:26.800 --> 24:28.040
I want to know

24:29.040 --> 24:31.320
what method you have

24:32.040 --> 24:33.600
to walk out of this courtyard.

24:38.240 --> 24:39.600
I cannot get out,

24:40.680 --> 24:42.280
and you will not kill me,

24:42.880 --> 24:43.840
will you?

24:45.880 --> 24:46.840
Not right now.

24:48.120 --> 24:49.080
But someday.

24:50.120 --> 24:51.880
Then there is still time.

24:54.640 --> 24:56.000
You are waiting for Xiao Wuyang.

24:58.320 --> 24:59.520
Not only him.

25:03.600 --> 25:05.840
I arranged for 400 men
and still failed to kill him.

25:15.840 --> 25:16.800
White Hair,

25:17.480 --> 25:19.320
you really are a bit mad.

25:19.920 --> 25:22.160
Every moment you are trapped here,

25:22.240 --> 25:24.840
anything that happens outside,
you cannot respond to.

25:25.600 --> 25:27.480
You know that, don't you?

25:33.120 --> 25:34.080
Come in.

25:54.360 --> 25:55.960
Greetings, General Fengshan,

25:57.320 --> 25:58.480
Mr. Huai'an.

25:59.760 --> 26:01.960
Have you decided to join the Huben Army?

26:02.040 --> 26:03.920
Where is your merit?

26:04.960 --> 26:06.760
Yang Chuhao is already dead.

26:07.920 --> 26:09.520
That is my merit.

26:12.000 --> 26:13.040
These injuries

26:14.240 --> 26:15.800
came from a little trouble

26:16.840 --> 26:18.600
on the way just now.

27:10.360 --> 27:11.360
Is he dead?

27:11.440 --> 27:12.480
Almost.

27:13.760 --> 27:14.800
Before dawn,

27:14.880 --> 27:17.840
he should die in the streets of Chang'an.

27:28.960 --> 27:30.600
It was Ye Zheng's sword.

27:31.640 --> 27:33.440
I have trained with the blade
for ten years.

27:33.520 --> 27:35.400
This is the first time
I've faced such a trying foe.

27:36.720 --> 27:40.200
Ye Zheng is truly a worthy opponent.

27:40.800 --> 27:41.920
It is a pity

27:42.680 --> 27:43.920
he is too ruled by his emotions.

27:49.560 --> 27:50.880
No matter what,

27:51.400 --> 27:53.120
my feelings for Xiaoqing are real.

28:28.520 --> 28:31.880
I told you this is the risk
you have to take.

28:31.960 --> 28:33.040
Trapped here,

28:33.120 --> 28:36.120
you cannot deal with anything outside.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.360
This courtyard

28:42.400 --> 28:43.600
is truly lovely.

28:47.800 --> 28:48.880
Tonight

28:49.880 --> 28:51.360
is the end.

28:58.520 --> 28:59.560
Go ahead.

29:25.320 --> 29:28.400
Sir, Yulong Ridge lies ahead.

29:29.440 --> 29:30.840
In these past decades,

29:31.480 --> 29:32.640
the wisest,

29:33.280 --> 29:34.800
the strongest,

29:35.760 --> 29:37.160
and the most cunning

29:37.240 --> 29:39.200
have all gathered in Chang'an.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.400
Tell me.

29:48.160 --> 29:49.760
Is it time?

30:19.960 --> 30:22.160
It is snowing
even after the Spring Equinox.

30:23.680 --> 30:26.000
This is not a peaceful year.

30:26.080 --> 30:29.640
When your father died,
it was also a snowy night.

30:31.440 --> 30:34.920
Your father, covered in wounds,
was brought before me.

30:35.520 --> 30:38.120
And the one who delivered
the final blow was not Liu Ziyan.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.280
It was me.

30:40.040 --> 30:42.200
I even gathered his remains

30:43.000 --> 30:44.680
and built a grave for him.

30:46.960 --> 30:48.800
Did you find that grave?

30:49.680 --> 30:52.120
Did you ever weep before it?

31:00.800 --> 31:04.120
LIU ZIWEN

31:11.040 --> 31:13.440
Accept your fate, White Hair.

31:13.520 --> 31:15.800
Stop struggling.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.440
Accept such a fate?

31:22.000 --> 31:23.600
Tell me.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.280
How does one accept fate?

31:27.560 --> 31:29.200
One kowtow at a time.

31:29.960 --> 31:32.520
That is how the word fate is written.

32:06.080 --> 32:07.440
I'll kill him for you.

32:21.160 --> 32:23.720
Ever since you rescued
Gu Yu from Chang'an,

32:24.400 --> 32:27.160
the four regional commanders
have all pressed me for battle orders.

32:27.960 --> 32:31.600
They refuse to see Gu Yu return
with the northern Baiwenhu Army

32:32.320 --> 32:34.600
and join forces with Xiao Wuyang's army.

32:40.280 --> 32:42.640
Many people are destined to die tonight.

32:45.320 --> 32:46.440
Go.

32:47.080 --> 32:49.360
I permit you to die where you grew up.

32:50.600 --> 32:53.160
My men outside will see you off
on your final road.

33:42.840 --> 33:43.960
You are tired.

33:45.200 --> 33:47.200
I will stir the charcoal and leave.

33:48.080 --> 33:50.520
Cease this pretense of serving me.

33:51.800 --> 33:53.360
Come back tomorrow.

33:54.280 --> 33:57.040
Tell me what you want.

34:08.239 --> 34:10.320
I had wanted to kill Xie Huai'an myself.

34:10.960 --> 34:12.880
Killing a man like him

34:13.920 --> 34:15.280
felt like an accomplishment.

34:16.040 --> 34:19.199
But now it seems that if he were to die
under the blades of the Huben,

34:19.840 --> 34:22.320
as the tales say his father did,

34:26.480 --> 34:27.360
it'd be far more interesting.

35:15.480 --> 35:18.760
When I was seven,
I learned to make dumplings.

35:18.840 --> 35:20.720
And I even wrapped

35:22.520 --> 35:23.520
a copper coin inside,

35:24.560 --> 35:26.200
hoping you would be the one to eat it.

35:27.560 --> 35:29.800
Hoping you would live a thousand years,

35:30.400 --> 35:31.680
safe and at peace.

35:38.800 --> 35:41.800
Does that Xie Huai'an have a weakness?

35:42.600 --> 35:43.680
He does.

35:44.880 --> 35:46.840
He wants too badly to kill someone.

35:53.640 --> 35:54.720
That is right.

35:55.440 --> 35:56.640
You guessed correctly.

35:59.040 --> 36:00.760
He wants to kill me.

36:06.000 --> 36:08.120
One who keeps thinking only
of killing you,

36:09.120 --> 36:10.600
does that count as remarkable?

36:11.880 --> 36:13.840
Killing intent is instinct.

36:13.920 --> 36:15.840
If one is too driven by instinct,

36:16.680 --> 36:18.480
it is easy to lose oneself.

36:19.480 --> 36:20.320
On the contrary,

36:21.240 --> 36:24.520
to be able to put down the desire
to kill someone

36:25.560 --> 36:27.640
is what makes one extraordinary.

36:35.280 --> 36:36.360
General.

36:37.520 --> 36:39.240
I heard the elder Huben say

36:40.240 --> 36:41.720
that when you were young,

36:41.800 --> 36:43.360
you were also steeped in bloodshed.

36:53.960 --> 36:55.120
Later,

36:56.000 --> 36:57.440
you appeared.

36:59.680 --> 37:00.520
Me?

37:02.280 --> 37:05.000
The number of people
who kill for me keeps growing

37:05.080 --> 37:06.320
and I am getting older.

37:07.160 --> 37:10.440
I no longer need to swing every blade
with my life on the line.

37:11.040 --> 37:12.520
Perhaps for this very reason,

37:13.120 --> 37:15.840
my killing intent slowly faded.

37:17.680 --> 37:18.520
General.

37:20.400 --> 37:21.560
I am returning to Chang'an.

37:23.520 --> 37:25.280
I am the one who kills for the general.

37:26.440 --> 37:27.320
On this trip back,

37:29.320 --> 37:30.760
I will kill Xie Huai'an.

37:48.400 --> 37:50.640
As long as you return safely.

38:24.280 --> 38:30.560
THE FESTIVAL APPROACHES SPRING,
AND THE NEW YEAR IS BLESSED
